ycevo-fortran is a translation of computational routines from the R package
"ycevo: Nonparametric Estimation of the Yield Curve Evolution".

Original authors listed by the package:
Bonsoo Koo, Nathaniel Tomasetti, Kai-Yang Goh, and Yangzhuoran Fin Yang.

